WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.450
Every business has a number it wants to move.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.790
But numbers don't make decisions. People do.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.930
So we start with behaviour, not the brief.

4
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.660
We observe how people really decide,

5
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.670
find the moment they hesitate,

6
00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.830
and design the change that moves them.

7
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:22.280
Strategy, design, technology and film, shaped by behavioural science.

8
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:26.490
Fewer guesses. Clearer decisions. Results you can measure.

9
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:30.850
Book a discovery call with the founders of Cognexa today.

